// (S-947 (b).) The cut is in the value of an arm of a `match`, and in the default value of a field of a `struct`; the
// next line starts an item at the indentation of the line that opened the unit. The line head after a
// line that goes on is a line head, so the item ends the unit; the E0002 points at the innermost bracket
// that is never closed at the place the unit stops (the `{` of the `match`, the `{` of the `struct`), and the
// item is read, so its users find it (no E0302).

